[Fast code is the destination. This blog is about the road there.]($text.attrs('lede'))

SWAR tricks, bit-twiddling, SIMD, branch-killing, cache-friendly layouts... the final benchmark is rarely the interesting part. The wrong turns are. The dead ends, the small intuitions, and those _"wait, why does THIS make it faster?!"_ moments along the way.

Pick a post below, and if you think my benchmark is wrong, [tell me]($link.page('about')), I'd genuinely love that :P
